## Classification

### Primary Category

Functional Objective

---

### Secondary Classification

Derived Operational Objective

---

### Engineering Domain

Environmental Perception

---

### Classification Justification

SO-F-002 defines the first operational capability required to realize the root functional objective established by SO-F-001.

Its engineering responsibility is limited to the acquisition and maintenance of observations describing the operating environment. It does not interpret, evaluate, or act upon those observations.

As the first operational capability in the adaptive processing pipeline, it establishes the information foundation upon which subsequent Functional Objectives depend.

---

### Classification Notes

- Derived directly from SO-F-001.
- First operational objective within the Functional Objective hierarchy.
- Parent objective for future perception-specific objectives.
- Changes to this objective may affect all downstream objectives that consume observational information.
